  where A = Σ aᵢ[D, bᵢ] is a 1-form built from the algebra.

  For the spectral triple (M₄(ℂ), ℂ⁴, D):
  - Fluctuations in the su(4) direction → gauge bosons (gluons, W, Z, B-L)
