    ALL fundamental force carriers in one framework:

    | Carrier | Spin | Count | Subalgebra | Physical d.o.f. |
    |---------|------|-------|-----------|-----------------|
    | Gluon | 1 | 8 | su(3) | 8 × 2 = 16 |
    | W± | 1 | 2 | su(2)_L | 2 × 3 = 6 (massive) |
    | Z | 1 | 1 | su(2)_L/u(1) | 1 × 3 = 3 (massive) |
    | Photon | 1 | 1 | u(1)_em | 1 × 2 = 2 |
