    | Leptoquark | 1 | 3 | su(4)\sm | 3 × 2 = 6 |
    | Graviton | 2 | 1 | spin(3,1) | 1 × 2 = 2 |

    Total carrier species: 8 + 2 + 1 + 1 + 1 + 3 + 1 = 17
